     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Next: take the skycutter ship to Mulgore and hand The Earthen Ring to Alaana Stormwalker, then run east out of Mulgore to the Crossroads. The guide continues with The Barrens 12-20 (Horde). Skip its first step: Conscript of the Horde starts in Razor Hill, which you never visited."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Full story: this route already includes the whole island story up to The Earthen Ring. The only island quests left out are the Strange Hermit's three quests (optional step above, not play-tested) and other classes' class quests."
      }
